quic_initial_gosuslugi_ru.bin is made from quic_initial_vk_com.bin of zapret by bol-van
(https://github.com/bol-van/zapret/blob/2aaa2f7cf3c33b282727784738059d73279bc60f/files/fake/quic_initial_vk_com.bin)
with tools/make_quic_fake.py of fnport: the same ClientHello with gosuslugi.ru as the server name,
re-encrypted with fresh QUIC Initial keys.

